	(text "MCU_VDDA = VCC through R203 (0R), bypass C206..C208 to AGND.\nAVCC LDO remains for external analog amplifiers only.\nJ201: 1=3V3, 2=GND, 3=M1_BRKIN, 4=M2_BRKIN.\nFAULT inputs use pullups; external open-drain HEALTH holds LOW only while healthy.\nConfigure each timer break polarity HIGH; unplugged defaults to brake. No autonomous trip comparator fitted.\nCurrent limits/thresholds and external fault source remain to be designed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 210 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2c962573-a3d8-498d-a838-0ac358611ae8")
	)
	(text "M1 TIMER0: PA8/9/10 AF1; PB13/14 AF2, PB15 AF1. BRKIN PB12 AF4.\nM2 TIMER7: PC6/7 AF3, PC8 AF2; PC0/1/2 AF0. BRKIN PA6 AF4.\nM1 currents PA0/1/2; M2 currents PA3/4/5 (ADC0/ADC1).\nIBUS: PC3 / PC5; VBUS PC4; NTC PE7 / PE8 (ADC2).\nHall M1 PB4/5/0 TIMER2; M2 PD12/13/14 TIMER3. Release PB4 JTAG, keep SWD.\nShared SPI2 PC10/11/12 AF2; GPIO chip selects PE2 / PE3.\nVA/VB/VC/COM and M2_VBUS stay on power-sheet testpoints, not MCU ADC."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 150 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c28cd2f5-f130-4767-a397-30b154ecaf90")
